{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "5d17e11169c9b5c41975f4b1843de3edb9cde6633a2184cf87925c4e53fd3406", "ja": "お芝居は、みんなでするのです！", "zh": "演戏是要由大家一起来演的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e1bb583dae7dc3c52b6029ce8ce3c316d871e34381ab7ab50522595fc15090dd", "ja": "『おとぎの国の物語』の稽古が始まった。\n桃子は役作りに悩むメンバー達から色々な\n相談を受け、難しい内容に困ってしまう。\nレッスン室が重い雰囲気になりかけるが、\nまつりのアドバイスが空気を変える。", "zh": "《童话王国的故事》开始排练了。\n苦于塑造角色的成员们向桃子请教许多问题，\n难以回答的问题让她伤透脑筋，\n练习室险些陷入沉重的氛围，\n但茉莉的意见改变了气氛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "af7811b959c487a3514707a55f1e66be836dab5a872c0a9e89ccf000be4265f6", "ja": "（『おとぎの国の物語』の稽古が始まった。\nさて、みんなの様子はどうかな……）", "zh": "（《童话王国的故事》开始排练了。\n好，来看看大家状况如何……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "3306162d5dd5fc424e0e3c2608b187e8c334c26386e66c7e8888a0b1fac190a3", "ja": "それじゃ、次はシーン8から始めるね。\n少女がオオカミと森の中で出会うシーンだよ！", "zh": "那么，接下来从第8幕开始喔。\n这是少女在森林里遇见大野狼的场景！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "ceb65475ba60642c77c1b1a6e71185245eaac39ad8244e06e5564f4ec70ac17a", "ja": "あれ？　なんだか見たことのない景色……。\nもしかしてわたし、道を間違えちゃった……？", "zh": "奇怪？这片景色好陌生……\n我该不会走错路了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "ec0dd647f488796769698ef7e2926970d57477acfcec073140dffffb7b123de4", "ja": "ど、どうしよう……帰り道が、\nわからなくなっちゃいました……うぅ……。", "zh": "怎、怎么办……\n不知道回家的路要怎么走了……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "061b7b13014b9ae976662c8f4d7ebb94f45c4ac0011e9c880072c7ae768438f1", "ja": "お、お母さぁん……お姉ちゃん……ぐすっ。", "zh": "妈、妈妈……姊姊……呜呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1005_se", "source_sha256": "14c468c82099cb5a701b0e8229c722719a6ca26f0e37f00f015878f3d89eae31", "ja": "ガサガサッ", "zh": "（沙沙作响）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "2778c04876d17093c91b26911a9583d0fa39b8e4d3d96c2ec28961c781702fd2", "ja": "きゃっ！？\n……そ、そこにいるのは、誰？", "zh": "呀！？\n……是、是谁在那里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "0c123af5d1338b3f7342d624aa15321be403438893486cefcf7ba421b4e30f54", "ja": "ん？　……わぁ！？　ににに、人間っ！！？\nどどど、どうしてこんなところに人間がいるんだ！？", "zh": "嗯？……哇啊！？人人人人类！！？\n为为为为什么这种地方会出现人类！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "36737b9f787ab12973b3d471546e99c38453d1b20a0982a6b9f923d4eb6f1844", "ja": "あっ！　耳に、尻尾……。もしかしてあなたは、\n森に住んでるっていうオオカミさんですか？", "zh": "啊！耳朵和尾巴……\n难不成你就是住在森林里的大野狼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "2490614a1901236405379461b4707ca978c33d6c7489546ecac5bd3eeabae76c", "ja": "ぎくっ！？　じ、自分はオオカミなんて\n名前じゃないぞ！　ビッキーだ！", "zh": "呃！？本、本人的名字不是大野狼喔！\n是毕奇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "429b1082bbb00803fcf6d1c4fadd563169acdd1ae6c3fcd643b3f3e597d28347", "ja": "ビッキーさん……そうですか、はじめまして！\nわたしは、リカっていいます！", "zh": "毕奇……这样啊，初次见面，你好！\n我叫莉卡！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "e99af5293589bb6e84940a509592b5c1c0187fef1ca28677d8720dfa44c82da1", "ja": "あ、はじめまして……って、うぎゃー！　そうじゃ\nなくて！　に、人間なんか、ちっとも怖くないぞー！", "zh": "啊，幸会……呃，呜呀──！\n不是啦！本、本人一点也不怕人类喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1af81b5a4088c0d1054cd53ce57bf84e856ebb1cbd3683fb5f3f4e898270c4ed", "ja": "響、星梨花、お疲れさま！　初めての読み合わせ\nにしては、ふたりとも良かったんじゃないか？", "zh": "响、星梨花，辛苦了！\n以第一次对台词来说，你们都表现得很不错嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "bff9d1e5e0fa378ce1e56b9c5863785dff08194a77e0a3725fa05e6a2f05cd04", "ja": "姫もそう思うのです。特に響ちゃんの\nびくびくオオカミさん、きゅーと！だったのです。", "zh": "公主也是这么认为的喔。\n尤其是小响诠释的胆小大野狼，超可爱的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "7010cdd535f501b941fd5661c83fbeea36dca657bd0f2d48b526841703430fc4", "ja": "ん？　……ねぇまつり、\n今の、自分、ほめられたんだよね？", "zh": "嗯？……欸，茉莉，\n刚才那句话，是在夸奖本人对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "92c92d330b502bb2e08ef8768e7f03dcfd77429230f7f55fd96261faa1a0e423", "ja": "ほ？　もちろんなのです。", "zh": "哦？当然的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "2e9db49c040afb097f3a39d5f29b7ad699e998649c35f8baeee33f4021d18efe", "ja": "響さん、お疲れさまでした！\n人間がこわいオオカミさん、とっても面白いですね！", "zh": "响姊姊，辛苦了！\n害怕人类的大野狼非常有趣呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "ccd5c5e51d20e339bb8a477b9476f18962e23c843ebffd7dd86c4da80aefe5ee", "ja": "そうかなぁ？　せっかくオオカミなのに、自分、\nなんかカッコ悪くないか……？　桃子、どう思う？", "zh": "是吗？可是难得能饰演大野狼耶，\n不觉得本人有点逊吗……？桃子，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "c5cd31402f5f9f93fcd2cca742c0ac1774d0aa535478180fded5cc11e3ce7cd4", "ja": "え？　桃子にそんなこと言われても……\nこの話のオオカミは、そういう役なんだし。", "zh": "咦？就算问桃子也没用呀……\n这个故事里的大野狼本来就是那种角色嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "0862fcec202625d311795b8abd81e2dd9dc0a3f70c04c3445f1694361bc2aae5", "ja": "うーん、そっかぁ。\nヘンじゃなければいいんだけど。", "zh": "唔～这样啊。\n不会奇怪的话倒也无所谓啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "7bd3e8b620f915d641cccf25acbb5000bfb8608617fc262e91f80c0509973f11", "ja": "変じゃなければ……う～ん。\nたしかに、オオカミとしては変かもしれないけど……。", "zh": "不会奇怪的话……唔嗯～\n这样的大野狼确实有点反常……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "4694c80781486689e05f6eb78193356bce63699429bc024e998ddb3e19a64a2f", "ja": "やっぱり、桃子もそう思う？\nうーん、どうしたらヘンに見えないかなぁ。", "zh": "你果然也有同感吗？\n嗯～要怎样做才不会显得奇怪呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "aad36259cc5f16e6df53135e7e9be080ea20dcdd39c51c624def105f6b1a9ac0", "ja": "なあなあ、桃子。\nオレもちょっと聞きたいコトあるんだけど、いい？", "zh": "欸欸，桃子，\n我也有问题想问你，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "9dfb17d6807bc29a886bc95c11c83e0424acdf79d4426d2352c0fb47eaf743b4", "ja": "あっ……うん。何？　昴さん。", "zh": "啊……嗯，是什么问题呢，昴姊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1024_047sub", "source_sha256": "01778cfddb19487f53e0eaf4773e7952ddcb694fa03112f20ece20e1bd0aa923", "ja": "旅人って、どう不思議なのかよくわからなくってさ。\n記憶喪失ってだけで、不思議な感じが出せるのかな？", "zh": "我不太懂旅人是怎样不可思议。\n只是丧失记忆就会给人不可思议的感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "5310e0861663b5fbfa933b6307acf97c975f97234883322bacdee176b7742c7f", "ja": "う、う～ん、それは……。\n昴さんが、旅人さんの気持ちになってみないと……。", "zh": "唔、唔～这个嘛……\n昴姊必须先尝试体会旅人的心境才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "ecc9aedc8e1c0fd76d7e6e6f6bf256155f8ae226d8ad9ffd3c3722c4ef45b6dd", "ja": "旅人の気持ちか……\n記憶喪失って、どんな気持ちなんだろうな～？", "zh": "旅人的心境吗……\n丧失记忆会是怎样的心境啊～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "46276ee727f4994fe087ee6225d75093336dc752d81c62dbae8ec10ee0ca7938", "ja": "う……。それは、けっこう難しい……かも。\n桃子も、記憶そうしつになったことないし……。", "zh": "唔……这个好像……挺难回答的，\n毕竟桃子也没有丧失记忆的经验……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "0aaad38086ff27c12362bc44b1883e682a53b98493bb5975ae91397a7b06c410", "ja": "そうだよな～。いくら桃子でも、記憶喪失には\nなったコトないよな！　オレだってないんだし！", "zh": "说得也是～就算是桃子，\n也不会有丧失记忆的经验嘛！我自己也没有！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "6ebf1c6e4bf311ed0b719ad2c2e37977a4b7229738080889007779ebd8b59d25", "ja": "うぅ……。", "zh": "唔唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "c096bdd667a0b97489fd6bc7e6f696d63b20d3559a3cd2c6f3ab898d989cf67e", "ja": "も、桃子ちゃん……。{$P$}さん、\nわたし、余計なことを言ってしまったんでしょうか？", "zh": "小、小桃……{$P$}先生，\n我刚才是不是太多嘴了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "fe0b7c222788edfd14bc1f56ab9548e040440c2d985642beed1e374267248c2f", "ja": "（悩んでいる桃子を見て、星梨花も気を落としている。\nレッスン場全体が重い空気になってしまったな……）", "zh": "（看到桃子苦恼的样子，星梨花也沮丧了起来。\n整间练习室的气氛都变沉重了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "3f0c3f0ca28a521a9b18035e1263f6b1f3dfe542a9658161e1cf165b5ec486cc", "ja": "響ちゃん、心配することないのです。\nびくびくオオカミさんは、心が優しいだけなのです！", "zh": "小响，不用担心的喔，\n胆小的大野狼只是内心温柔而已的呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1033_021mat", "source_sha256": "8e016720a22cfd1c5b3e941e6b1098798dce751dcd143064ee4f2ef62a7d4f51", "ja": "そうですよね？\n{$P$}さん、桃子ちゃん。", "zh": "没错吧？\n{$P$}先生、小桃子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "a6053df1dd448ea64e0a08151839e505465190cd40012024d9ff59d7693ca1d1", "ja": "あっ……う、うん。このオオカミは、\n臆病だけど、優しい、いいオオカミだと思うな。", "zh": "啊……没、没错，这个大野狼虽然懦弱，\n但牠应该是温柔的好大野狼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1035_013hib", "source_sha256": "e2d5f3dad7b11a0e1844ac6a038e165e439c895af182839eab60e2994f04ad00", "ja": "そうだよね！？　自分もそう思ってたんだ！\nカッコいいかは別として、良いオオカミだと思うぞ！", "zh": "对吧！？本人也是这么想的！\n先不管帅不帅的问题，牠应该是个好大野狼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "c670d64756ea5642a0aa8e223a6a82ae864e32ad0983b480f9cad3dd02ebb0dc", "ja": "わたしも、ビッキーさんはとっても優しい\nオオカミさんだと思います！", "zh": "我也觉得毕奇是非常温柔的大野狼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1037_021mat", "source_sha256": "29dc0ca60cae46381b05f4d195800d55cf83300409d228caa71eeb25aa776bf5", "ja": "姫も、そう思うのです。\nそれから……昴ちゃん！", "zh": "公主也有同感。\n还有……小昴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1038_047sub", "source_sha256": "33b04c9af7077bfeaf32a4650e0c16e51c8a6217beed148b5605518bfbd0d29e", "ja": "えっ！？　お、オレ？　何！？", "zh": "咦！？我、我吗？什么事！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1039_021mat", "source_sha256": "9d0b6e50ec2811ee0f5e9e8e2ac2790555b163336436039d06c0055a13ef76e7", "ja": "オオカミさんも旅人さんも、ひとりじゃないのですよ。\n映画はみんなで作るもの。みんなでお芝居するのです。", "zh": "大野狼和旅人都不是孤独的呀，\n电影是大家一起创造出来的，要由大家一起来演的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1040_021mat", "source_sha256": "e0869745967ae98e9b785d84b4749fea1c9c021c6cafdd65e2735bfe522c7c10", "ja": "まだまだ、時間はあるのです。\n旅人さんについて、どんどん研究しましょー！", "zh": "还有很多时间的唷，\n继续研究旅人这个角色吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1041_047sub", "source_sha256": "5957bbb3afdf1b0d888877f1ea9f35debba96088e7e4244b910dea105a017c43", "ja": "まつり……そうだよな！　オレ、もっと旅人の\n気持ちがわかるように、がんばらなくちゃな。", "zh": "茉莉……说得也是！\n我得努力去理解旅人的心境才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1042_021mat", "source_sha256": "6b61030677d0a9661cdc68e2c9d87003104d4e34e44d72e29a6d2fcd9cf22689", "ja": "姫たちの練習は、始まったばかりなのです。\n桃子ちゃん、これからも指導よろしくなのです♪", "zh": "公主我们的练习才刚开始的喔，\n小桃子，今后也要麻烦你指导我们的唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1043_049mom", "source_sha256": "c970fc4865cc8a17f472553608d5740b7be2723cb6d3e78eea16c4a74f27314f", "ja": "えっ？　……あ、うん、わかった！\nみんな！　厳しくいくから、覚悟しててね！", "zh": "咦？……啊，嗯，好的！\n各位！桃子会很严厉，要做好心理准备喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_02_1044_p", "source_sha256": "9db38834c27fb509400ecce8410d7f9103659b8c99458ce43fbe41d3a56955fe", "ja": "（まつりの一言をきっかけに、みんなの気持ちが\n上向きになったな。この調子で進めていこう！）", "zh": "（茉莉的一句话，让大家的情绪都好转了呢。\n就按照这个感觉前进吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
